{"id":"vod_bf_23272","vodId":"23272","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"名侦探柯南OVA4","name_cn":"名侦探柯南OVA4","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-24/7a2beed0fa77fb27d25d1ac2dde8cbe9.jpg"},"summary":"在一列从东京开往大阪的特快列车上，坐着一位尊贵而特殊的客人。她是来自欧洲英格拉姆帝国女王莎莉贝丝，随行的还有其年幼的儿子菲利浦王子。女王拥有一颗欧洲最大的宝石——水晶之母，这也引起了怪盗基德的注意。为了防止基德得手，女王身边布置大批保镖和警力。中森警官是日本警方的总代表，而他的女儿青子以及基德的真身快斗也同在这列火车之上。　　眼看离预定时间越来越近，快斗却始终没有找到宝石真正的藏匿地点。与此同时，国际宝石大盗杰卡尔和罗丝也尾随前来，他们企图在基德得手之际趁火打劫。同在火车上的柯南从伪装成乘务员的罗丝身上看出蹊跷。一场宝石的攻防战随即展开……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动画,日韩动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 19:47:48","classic":true,"classicRank":37,"franchise":"名侦探柯南","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanOVA4/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanOVA4/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanOVA4/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanOVA4/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanOVA4/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanOVA4/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanOVA4/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanOVA4/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanOVA4/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanOVA4/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanOVA4/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/mingzhentankenanOVA4/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T15:02:10.878